[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/

# Asset meta files must be kept for assets that are tracked.
# Only ignore meta files whose asset is also ignored.
!/[Aa]ssets/**/*.meta

# Autogenerated Jetbrains Rider plugin
/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*

